From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] explorer: the other displays' taskbars: pinned programs, thumbnails and auto-hide

7751's bars on the other displays had only the windows' buttons and stayed out with "Automatically
hide the taskbar". As on Windows, with the buttons on all taskbars each bar has the pinned
programs that are not running (a click starts one), and with auto-hide each bar tucks away at its
edge by itself and comes back when the pointer reaches it; the pointer resting on a window's
button shows its thumbnails above that bar, as on the main one.
---
